#: ../../source/dashdash_CHANGES.md:325
msgid ""
"Transform the option key on the `opts` object returned from "
"`<parser>.parse()` for convenience. Currently this is just `s/-/_/g`, "
"e.g. '--dry-run' -> `opts.dry_run`. This allow one to use hyphen in "
"option names (common) but not have to do silly things like `opt[\"dry-"
"run\"]` to access the parsed results."
msgstr ""

